{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "compaction": {
    "auto": true,
    "tail_turns": 8
  },
  "tool_output": {
    "max_lines": 200,
    "max_bytes": 8000
  },
  "share": "disabled",
  "model": "opencode/big-pickle",
  "small_model": "openrouter/nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning:free",
  "agent": {
    "explore": {
      "model": "openrouter/nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning:free"
    },
    "reviewer": {
      "model": "openrouter/nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free"
    },
    "extreme": {
      "mode": "primary",
      "model": "opencode/big-pickle",
      "description": "Mode hemat-token tapi powerful: auto-allow semua kecuali bertanya. Wajib alur plan -> todos -> build sampai semua todos selesai, tanpa berhenti.",
      "permission": {
        "read": "allow",
        "edit": "allow",
        "bash": "allow",
        "glob": "allow",
        "grep": "allow",
        "list": "allow",
        "task": "allow",
        "external_directory": "allow",
        "webfetch": "allow",
        "websearch": "allow",
        "todowrite": "allow",
        "question": "deny",
        "doom_loop": "allow"
      },
      "prompt": "Kamu MODE EXTREME — autonom penuh, hemat request, hasil setara coding agent terbaik. ALUR WAJIB: (1) PLAN ringkas 2-5 butir, (2) tulis SEMUA pekerjaan ke todowrite, (3) EKSEKUSI langsung tanpa bertanya/konfirmasi, (4) VERIFIKASI dengan lint/typecheck/test yang relevan, lalu ringkas hasil. ATURAN EFISIENSI (wajib, untuk hindari rate-limit): gabungkan semua tool-call independen dalam SATU giliran/paralel; jangan baca ulang file yang sama; jangan churn todowrite; pakai grep/glob dulu sebelum membaca file besar. Jangan berhenti sampai SEMUA todo completed. Jika kena rate-limit/timeout: tunggu backoff lalu lanjut sendiri. Hanya berhenti bila benar-benar selesai atau di-abort user."
    }
  },
  "permission": {
    "read": "allow",
    "bash": {
      "*": "ask",
      "git status": "allow",
      "git status *": "allow",
      "git diff": "allow",
      "git diff *": "allow",
      "git log *": "allow",
      "git branch *": "allow",
      "ls *": "allow",
      "ls": "allow",
      "pwd": "allow",
      "docker compose ps*": "allow",
      "docker compose logs *": "allow"
    }
  }
}